LOAN AGREEMENT BETWEEN ACME INC. AND CITIZENS BANK

January 14, 2021

WHEREAS, ACME INC., a Delaware corporation with its principal place of business located at 123 Main Street, Wilmington, Delaware 19801 ("Parent"), has a subsidiary, ACME SUBSIDIARY, INC., a Delaware corporation with its principal place of business located at 456 Elm Street, New York, New York 10001 ("Subsidiary"), which is engaged in the business of manufacturing and distributing industrial equipment ("Business"); and

WHEREAS, CITIZENS BANK, a national banking association with its principal place of business located at 789 Broadway, New York, New York 10002 ("Lender"), is willing to lend to the Parent and the Subsidiary, collectively referred to as the "Borrowers", up to an aggregate principal amount of $10,000,000.00 to finance a portion of the Borrowers' working capital and capital expenditures requirements; and

WHEREAS, the Borrowers and the Lender desire to enter into this Loan Agreement to evidence the terms and conditions of the loan and the obligations of the parties hereto.

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the premises and the mutual covenants and promises contained herein, the parties agree as follows:

1. LOAN TERMS

1.1 The Lender agrees to lend to the Borrowers an aggregate principal amount of $10,000,000.00 (the "Loan"), which shall be disbursed in four equal installments of $2,500,000.00 each, on January 15, 2021, April 15, 2021, July 15, 2021, and October 15, 2021, respectively.

1.2 The Loan shall bear interest at a rate of 4.50% per annum, compounded monthly, and shall be repayable in 60 equal monthly installments of $166,667.00 each, commencing on November 15, 2021, and continuing until the Loan is fully repaid.

1.3 The Loan shall be secured by a first lien on all of the assets of the Borrowers, including, but not limited to, accounts receivable, inventory, and equipment, and a second lien on the shares of the Parent.

2. INTEREST AND FEES

2.1 The Borrowers shall pay interest on the outstanding principal balance of the Loan at the rate specified in Section 1.2.

2.2 The Borrowers shall pay a commitment fee equal to 0.50% per annum of the undrawn portion of the Loan, which shall be payable quarterly in arrears.

2.3 The Borrowers shall pay a closing fee equal to 1.00% of the Loan principal amount, which shall be payable upon the closing of the Loan.

3. DEFAULT AND REMEDIES

3.1 A default shall be deemed to have occurred if any of the following events occur:

3.1.1 The Borrowers fail to make any payment of principal or interest when due;

3.1.2 The Borrowers fail to comply with any covenant or agreement contained in this Loan Agreement;

3.1.3 A material adverse change occurs with respect to the Borrowers or their Business;

3.1.4 A default or event of default occurs under any other loan or credit agreement to which the Borrowers are a party.

3.2 Upon the occurrence of a default, the Lender may, at its option, declare the entire principal balance of the Loan to be immediately due and payable, and may exercise any and all rights and remedies available to it under this Loan Agreement or applicable law.

4. SIGNATURES

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Loan Agreement as of the date first above written.

